# 懵然不知
(pos:成語)
<explanation>
yue:完全唔知道、一無所知嘅樣（多用嚟形容人對某件事毫無察覺）
eng:to be completely unaware; to know nothing about something
<eg>
yue:佢對件事懵然不知，仲笑住同人講笑。 (keoi5 deoi3 gin6 si6 mung2 jin4 bat1 zi1, zung6 siu3 zyu6 tung4 jan4 gong2 siu3.)
eng:He was completely unaware of the matter and was still joking with people.

 [end of text]


